title Cassette: recording with the MON lamp lit (Monitor on and running), for the user guide (docs/doc-images.tsv)
sizes 480x320 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO recording
env CASSETTE_DEMO_MONITOR on
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
shot recording-mon-lit
expect text "MON"
expect text "SOFT"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
